CHAPTER IV

FORMS OF VIOLENCE

Article 4

Forms of violence include:
a. physical violence;
b. psychological violence;
c. sexual violence;
d. neglect;
e. maltreatment;
f. exploitation; and/org. other violence.

Article 17

